            <div xml:id="d1170">

                <pb facs="0834" n="718" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg718"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/528.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 30, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s December 24. Foreign Office promises protection requested against
                    Temapache authorities by foreign oil companies if latter charges prove true.
                    Consul Tampico advised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
